01:10:40.520 --> 01:10:43.463
The first kind of materials is related to

01:10:43.463 --> 01:10:45.570
(speaks Chinese) materials

01:10:45.570 --> 01:10:50.570
and then related to the
Chinese Constitution in Taiwan.

01:10:51.120 --> 01:10:52.960
As you may already know that

01:10:54.690 --> 01:10:58.577
the constitution of the
Republic of China is drafted

01:10:59.980 --> 01:11:01.880
in Nanjing and then eventually migrated

01:11:01.880 --> 01:11:05.650
with the Nationalist
Government to Taiwan after '49.

01:11:05.650 --> 01:11:08.810
This is a very interesting
constitution in many ways.

01:11:08.810 --> 01:11:12.860
It contained a very
peculiar five-power system

01:11:12.860 --> 01:11:14.362
designed by Sun Yat-sen.

01:11:14.362 --> 01:11:15.195
Under this system,

01:11:15.195 --> 01:11:18.610
there are two different powers outside

01:11:18.610 --> 01:11:21.420
of the traditional free power system.

01:11:21.420 --> 01:11:24.257
We have the examination
power and control power.

01:11:24.257 --> 01:11:26.430
The control power which modeled
after the (speaks Chinese),

01:11:28.180 --> 01:11:31.810
the census system from Imperial China.

01:11:31.810 --> 01:11:33.580
There are quite lots of problems

01:11:33.580 --> 01:11:36.330
and difficulties created
by this constitution.

01:11:36.330 --> 01:11:39.200
Not only because this is
a Chinese constitution,

01:11:39.200 --> 01:11:41.870
made in China and then taken to Taiwan,

01:11:41.870 --> 01:11:46.473
but because of the disparate
Curio five-power constitution.

01:11:51.151 --> 01:11:53.660
To deal with these problems,

01:11:53.660 --> 01:11:56.530
we have a long list of "Interpretations

01:11:56.530 --> 01:11:58.860
by Justices of the Judicial Yuan",

01:11:58.860 --> 01:12:02.013
the judicial branch of the
Republic of China's government.

01:12:03.671 --> 01:12:04.673
There's a database.

01:12:06.865 --> 01:12:09.070
It may be something
quite big in this level,

01:12:09.070 --> 01:12:12.150
but I still find it very
intellectually stimulating

01:12:12.150 --> 01:12:16.770
to look at just these interpretations.

01:12:16.770 --> 01:12:18.310
It covers not only those

01:12:18.310 --> 01:12:21.470
constitutional level kind of problems,

01:12:21.470 --> 01:12:24.510
like territory or like the definition of

01:12:24.510 --> 01:12:27.130
who is or who is not civil servants,

01:12:27.130 --> 01:12:29.060
because that's quite problematic things

01:12:29.060 --> 01:12:32.500
under the system of examination power.

01:12:32.500 --> 01:12:34.570
You can also see a lot of very interesting

01:12:34.570 --> 01:12:37.430
and everyday life things
in these interpretations,

01:12:37.430 --> 01:12:42.087
including the regulations over adoption

01:12:43.770 --> 01:12:46.800
of children in the civic law

01:12:46.800 --> 01:12:49.020
and then the licensing
of medical practitioners,

01:12:49.020 --> 01:12:50.030
so and so forth.

01:12:50.030 --> 01:12:51.300
There's quite a lot of

01:12:51.300 --> 01:12:54.163
different things in these interpretations.

01:12:55.715 --> 01:12:59.340
These are all openly accessible online

01:12:59.340 --> 01:13:02.190
and then you can see the hyperlink here

01:13:02.190 --> 01:13:06.250
and also draw attention to another system,

01:13:06.250 --> 01:13:08.660
